        "text": "=You are a professional business analyst. Analyze the following weekly data from a Google Sheet and generate a single comprehensive, well-structured weekly report.\n\nDATA:\n{{ JSON.stringify($input.all().map(item => item.json), null, 2) }}\n\nReport Date: {{ $now.format('MM DD') }}\n\nPlease generate a complete weekly report in single clean HTML format (no markdown, pure HTML with inline CSS). The report should include:\n\n1. <h2>Executive Summary</h2> - A 2-3 sentence high-level overview of the week.\n2. <h2>Key Metrics</h2> - A summary table of the most important numbers from the data.\n3. <h2>Notable Trends & Highlights</h2> - Bullet points of what stood out this week.\n4. <h2>Areas of Concern</h2> - Any metrics or items that need attention.\n5. <h2>Action Items & Recommendations</h2> - Concrete next steps based on the data.\n\nStyling guidelines:\n- Use a clean, professional style with font-family: Arial, sans-serif\n- Use #2c3e50 for headings, #34495e for body text\n- Tables should have border-collapse: collapse, with alternating row colors (#f8f9fa and #ffffff)\n- Wrap the entire report in a <div> with max-width: 700px, margin: 0 auto, padding: 24px\n- Add a header section with the company name and report date\n\nReturn ONLY the HTML — no explanations, no markdown, no code fences.",
